24:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Choose an active track from the curriculum, not the destination photo",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose an active track from the curriculum, not the destination photo"}],[["$","p","The application instructions say to select one track and identify H as not recruiting for 2027. The programme overview describes different partner sequences and academic emphases. For example, A concerns global history and creative industries, while B concerns global markets and development. These are curricular distinctions to investigate, not recommendations for a particular applicant.",{"children":"The application instructions say to select one track and identify H as not recruiting for 2027. The programme overview describes different partner sequences and academic emphases. For example, A concerns global history and creative industries, while B concerns global markets and development. These are curricular distinctions to investigate, not recommendations for a particular applicant."}],["$","p","Build the following original comparison before drafting a personal statement. Read modules and degree prerequisites, identify relevant prior study and note the gap you still need to resolve. An attractive mobility city is a preference; it does not establish academic preparation or a suitable thesis environment.",{"children":"Build the following original comparison before drafting a personal statement. Read modules and degree prerequisites, identify relevant prior study and note the gap you still need to resolve. An attractive mobility city is a preference; it does not establish academic preparation or a suitable thesis environment."}],["$","p","Fictional example: a business graduate has studied firms and trade but has not taken a formal history module. They compare the real course requirements and describe their actual preparation. They do not rename a marketing assignment as historical research simply to fit a track title.",{"children":"Fictional example: a business graduate has studied firms and trade but has not taken a formal history module. They compare the real course requirements and describe their actual preparation. They do not rename a marketing assignment as historical research simply to fit a track title."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Choose an active track from the curriculum, not the destination photo","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Choose an active track from the curriculum, not the destination photo"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Track-fit worksheet",{"scope":"col","children":"Track-fit worksheet"}],["$","th","Evidence you can supply",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence you can supply"}],["$","th","Question still to resolve",{"scope":"col","children":"Question still to resolve"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Academic preparation"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Relevant modules and genuine assessed work"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Does it meet this track’s entry conditions?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Research interest"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A question grounded in that work"}],"$L28"],"$undefined"]}],"$L29","$L2a"]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f"]}]
